OL,3,ATV pundit put hand up woman's skirt,
OL,4,Ajury told
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former England rugby league player
OL,7,Fand TV pundit is accused of sexually
OL,8,Fassaulting a woman by putting her hand
OL,9,Fup her skirt and grabbing her
OL,10,Funderwear, a jury has been told.
OL,12,FDanika Priim, 42, is said to have
OL,13,Fcommitted the alleged offence in the
OL,14,Ftoilets at Horsforth Cricket Club in
OL,15,FLeeds on 22 July 2022.
OL,17,FOpening the case at Leeds Crown Court
OL,18,Fearlier, prosecutor Chloe Hudson told
OL,19,Fjurors the complainant had done nothing
OL,20,Fto "encourage, ask for, or imply that
OL,21,Fshe wanted to be sexually assaulted by
OL,22,Fthis defendant".
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
